    "title": "Wizard of Oz Slots Games",
    "description": "Wizard of Oz Slots is the only FREE Vegas style casino slot machine game from the Emerald City! Looking to play exciting free slots games online and offline? Play new slots with Dorothy, Scarecrow, Tin Man and the Cowardly Lion as they travel the Yellow Brick Road to see the Wizard of Oz. Relive the classic movie and win HUGE PAYOUTS with FREE SPINS and MEGA WILDS in an all-new casino slots game. Play nonstop free casino games online and collect MILLIONS OF CREDITS every day. Keep spinning to win bonus credits in the best free casino slot machine game.\r\n\r\nFeel the thrill of the Las Vegas adventure with stunning themed graphics. Click your heels, spin the wheel and hope the Wicked Witch of the West lets you hit the JACKPOT, in one of the best free slots game experiences!\r\n\r\nFREE CASINO SLOTS GAMES\r\n- Spin slot machines with the magic of the Emerald City\r\n- Play this exciting game with dual-reel slot machines\r\n- Casino slots games go anywhere you do. The free slots offline games let you continue your journey everywhere!\r\n\r\nWIN HUGE JACKPOTS\r\n- Play gold standard games with huge wins and UNBELIEVABLE payouts\r\n- Spin free slots for more chances to take home the MEGA WIN JACKPOT\r\n- Slots are centered around major scenes from the movie. Unlock levels to play through the whole story. Enjoy one of the most unique and nostalgic free casino games online\r\n\r\nMILLIONS OF CREDITS\r\n- Join the mania of free casino credits with dozens of BONUSES\r\n- Play a HUGE variety of AMAZING slot machine games for FREE\r\n- Challenge the devious Winged Monkeys and cash in on even more coins and prizes! Free slots casino games have never been so exciting\r\n-Feel like a hot shot as you play a great spin for 2022. Find the charm of becoming a master of slots; then double down on your winnings to make the 777 party really pop\r\n\r\nSLOTS WITH YOUR FRIENDS\r\n- Play free slots games ONLINE or OFFLINE and sync across all your devices, so you can take the casino wherever you go. Not even the frenzy of battle with the Wicked Witch of the West can stop you from crushing the greatest free slots game in Oz\r\n- Play without wifi: Get the feel of Vegas slots games, even with no internet connection\r\n- Unlock casino slot machines on your journey down the Yellow Brick Road with your friends, and send FREE GIFTS so you can spread the joy of free slots casino games\r\n\r\nWizard of Oz Slots is the BEST free app to play Vegas slots games! Spin to win in fun slot machines and new casino games, and experience the magic of the Las Vegas adventure everywhere you go! With the option for offline games, we truly mean everywhere!\r\n\r\nDownload Wizard of Oz Slots Casino today and find endless entertainment in free casino games! Brought to you by Zynga Games- the creators of Game of Thrones Slots, Hit it Rich Slots & Zynga Poker\r\n\r\nFollow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/wizardofoz.slots\r\nFollow-us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SlotsWizardOfOz\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\nThis game is intended for an adult audience and does not offer real money gambling or an opportunity to win real money or prizes. Practice or success at social gaming does not imply future success at real money gambling.\r\nThe game is free to play; however, in-app purchases are available for additional content and in-game currency.\r\nWizard of Oz Slots game is FREE to download and includes optional in-game purchases (including random items). Information about drop rates for random item purchases can be found in-game. If you wish to disable in-game purchases, please turn off the in-app purchases in your phone or tablet\u2019s Settings.\r\nUse of this application is governed by Zynga\u2019s Terms of Service, found at www.zynga.com/legal/terms-of-service.\r\nFor information about how Zynga uses personal data, please read our privacy policy at https://www.take2games.com/privacy.\r\nTHE WIZARD OF OZ and all related characters and elements are trademarks of and \u00a9 Turner Entertainment Co.\r\nJudy Garland as Dorothy from THE WIZARD OF OZ.\u2122 & \u00a9 Warner Bros. Entertainment Inc. (s24)",
